        "eyebrow": "Packaging",
        "heading": "Packaging for every need",
        "text": "<p>We understand our customers' needs and provide different types of packaging, keeping in mind the need to preserve the aroma and freshness of the spices. We have different sizes of pouch, box and jar packaging.</p>",
